  "reuse": "Replace complete account-create and admin-write scenario slices. Retained 109 keys must pass unchangedQualificationChecks and normal mutation/fixture/budget validation. Duplicate expected-failure signup returns before the new helper. Wrong-password sign-in and purchase-session refusal probes retain their original path. Existing automatic-sign-in reference setups take the unchanged completed-session path. Null apps fail required entry controls before the helper; changed null keys receive new evidence. All shared executable closures, including null, get exact reviewed mappings. Prior reviews remain cumulative.",
